          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem phi1_eq {t : ℝ} (ht : 0 < t) : phi1 t = hHc t * (hHc t * g0 t) := by\n  have he : Real.exp (-t ^ 2 / 2) ^ 2 = Real.exp (-t ^ 2) := by\n    rw [← Real.exp_nat_mul]; congr 1; push_cast; ring\n  have e : (hH 200 t * t * Real.exp (-t ^ 2 / 2)) ^ 2 =\n      hH 200 t * (hH 200 t * (t ^ 2 * Real.exp (-t ^ 2))) := by\n    rw [mul_pow, mul_pow, he]; ring\n  rw [phi1, TernaryGoldbach.Helfgott.etaPlus, e, ← hH_eq_hHc ht, g0]; push_cast; ring",
            "line": 209,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "TernaryGoldbach.Explicit.phi1_eq",
            "lines": [
              209,
              215
            ],
            "conclusion": "For $t>0$, `phi1 t = hHc t*(hHc t*g0 t)` with `g0 t = t^2 exp(-t^2)`, i.e. $\\eta_+^2=h_H^2t^2e^{-t^2}$ at $H=200$."
          },
